# Vendored upstream code must stay byte-identical to the official release it was taken from —
# vendor/xlsx/VENDOR.md records a sha256 per file, and a line-ending conversion would break every
# one of them on a machine with core.autocrlf=true. So: no EOL normalisation anywhere under here.
* -text

# These are third-party generated files: hide them from diff stats by default.
*.js linguist-generated
*.mjs linguist-generated
